  << /ActualText (I am a product\055oriented engineer\056 Took responsibility of release process\054 architectural decisions\056 Worked solo and in a team\056 Love discussions with products\054 designers\054 other roles and teams\056 Wanted to become a designer at first\056 Participated in hiring of iOS engineers in every company\056\nI write tests\056 Worked with UI and isolated tests\056 Have experience in different iOS architectures\054 optimizations\054 accessibility\054 native feel\056 My main tech stack is Swift\054 UIKit\054 SwiftUI\056\nPublished 2 talks on SwiftUI and Functional Architecture in Swift\056 Own a channel on Telegram\056)
