  << /ActualText (International company with B2C and B2B products\056 \nI started in a product\055oriented feature team\056 We were focused on the media content part of an app\056 Rewrote untestable parts in crucial map\055related screens\056 Made it testable and ready for change\056\nMoved to platform team in 2023\056 Improved testing infrastructure and design system\056 Improved daily DX and testability of crucial parts\056 Converted application to Swift Concurrency and Swift 6\056 Rewrote architecture layer to TCA with state\055based navigation\056 Living on the edge of development with AI\056)
